# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then re-include only the
# open-sourceable CAD addin stack. SchedAddin, mine-site standards,
# Deswik documentation, analysis scripts and certificates stay local.
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/
!deswik-mcp/
deswik-mcp/*
!deswik-mcp/src/
deswik-mcp/src/*
!deswik-mcp/src/Deswik.Addin/
!deswik-mcp/src/Deswik.Bridge/
!deswik-mcp/src/Deswik.Bridge.Standalone/
!deswik-mcp/src/Deswik.Bridge.Tests/
!deswik-mcp/tools/
deswik-mcp/tools/*
!deswik-mcp/tools/deswik.ps1
!deswik-mcp/tools/Test-AddinPreflight.ps1

# build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
